    "title": "Treinen injures shoulder, no longer an option for Dodgers' playoff 'pen - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago SAN FRANCISCO -- Righty reliever Blake Treinen injured his shoulder while warming up in the bullpen during the Dodgers' 4-3 win over the Giants on Saturday afternoon at Oracle Park. Manager Dave Roberts said Treinen's season is over, and he will undergo imaging on his shoulder to determine the extent of the injury. Read full article",
